    "active": true,
    "description": "<p><strong>CLASS TYPE</strong> Martial</p>\n<p>You are a disciplined master of martial technique, a warrior who has devoted their life to the perfection of weapon form and combat flow. Through rigorous training, mental clarity, and studied awareness, you have unlocked the secret language of movement—creating a unique and deadly combat rhythm.</p>\n<p>You do not simply fight. You perform a deadly dance where your blade, axe, or spear becomes an extension of thought. Unlike the brutish fury of the berserker or the tactical orders of the warlord, your strength lies in internal mastery and flawless timing. You adapt, flow, and dominate.</p>\n<p>You may want to play a Kensai if you want to excel in martial combat with intelligent control, flourish with distinctive fighting forms, and chain together devastating strikes with fluid precision.</p>\n<p><strong>MAGICAL TRADITION</strong> You have no normal spellcasting progression. At 1st level select a magical tradition. If a Kensai feat grants you an innate spell or an explicitly magical technique without specifying its tradition, it uses the selected tradition and Intelligence as your magical ability score.</p>",
    "classType": "Martial",
    "keyAbilityScores": "Dexterity (min +2), Intelligence (min +2), Constitution",
    "classSkills": "Acrobatics, Athletics, Climbing, Culture, Handle Animal, Meditation, Mental Focus, Perception, Survival",
    "grantedFeats": "1: Weapon Finesse",
    "classAbilities": "1: Combat Form, 1: Flow Strike, 1: Considered Mind, 1: Weapon Discipline, 1: Magical Tradition",
    "proficiencies": "You are proficient with all simple and martial weapons. You are proficient with all light armour, medium armour and bucklers.",
